1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:06,600
Day four. The pharmacy is on the far
side. Past the dead wing, with no
windows, no skylight, and no red
lights.

2
00:00:07,100 --> 00:00:10,000
Rule eight. Mark your way. Chalk,
tape, anything.

3
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:16,900
You write big arrows on the walls.
Every corner. Every door. You make a
trail of white arrows through the
dark.

4
00:00:17,400 --> 00:00:24,133
A shop that sells only sunglasses.
Fifty pairs on the wall, all looking
at you. A sign says sixty-seven
percent off.
